+### Readiness State Gate Criteria
+
+| State | Minimum gate criteria |
+|-------|------------------------|
+| NO-SHIP | Default until a named gate has admissible evidence. |
+| IMPL-GREEN | Tests, lint, types, and build pass; guard mutations prove validation, authorization, and idempotency checks are load-bearing. |
