+| UX-RC | INTEGRATION-GREEN plus every §4 LARP against a clean production bundle, with judged functional and experiential records. |
+| COMMERCIAL-RC | Not applicable until the promise names billing or paid entitlement; if introduced, real sandbox purchase, restore, webhook, and entitlement evidence become mandatory. |
+| SHIP-RC | UX-RC plus live two-principal isolation, controlled transport success and failure evidence, duplicate/retry probe, production configuration review, and adversarial suite pass. |
